s, but hard to master with physics based movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Four unique realms to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hours of gameplay with 99 checkpoints, 4 boss battles, and 285 coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evolving colors and accessories to collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Highly addictive and satisfying gameplay. You won't want to stop.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle with a BLACK HOLE !!!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","developers":["NINES\u2122"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935260/header.jpg?t=1744505621","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257096199,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096199/movie480.mp4?t=1739144907","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096199/movie_max.mp4?t=1739144907"},"name":"Gamplay Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257096199/c1f96c6f8b2b5c446ec9f95b2a48dbf0e1aab25a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739144907","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096199/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739144907","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096199/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739144907"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257096203,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096203/movie480.mp4?t=1739144909","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096203/movie_max.mp4?t=1739144909"},"name":"Gamplay Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257096203/861ed935cba3464e6ed48b643cd7ba5b543f5f1e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739144909","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25709